cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite the preprint below."
title: "ProteoTrace: proteomics-only sample-consistency QC for longitudinal cohorts"
abstract: >-
  Batch-corrected proteomic similarity preserves donor identity across visits
  and remains detectable through a 12% weight-loss intervention over 60 weeks.
  ProteoTrace screens longitudinal mass-spectrometry cohorts for sample swaps
  and donor inconsistencies without requiring genotype data.
